cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference these plugins, please cite them as below."
title: "claude-plugins: Claude Code plugins for usage limits and context (usage-guard, usage-bar, progress-bar)"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: MohammadMD1383
    website: "https://github.com/MohammadMD1383"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohammadMD1383/claude-plugins"
url: "https://mohammadmd1383.github.io/claude-plugins/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Claude Code
  - Claude Code plugins
  - usage limits
  - rate limits
  - status line
abstract: >-
  Open-source plugins for Claude Code. usage-guard makes Claude aware of claude.ai
  5-hour and weekly usage limits so it conserves budget, checkpoints and writes a
  hand-off before it is cut off. usage-bar shows context-window and limit usage
  above the prompt. progress-bar gives Claude a tool to report an exact percentage
  and shows it, with the current step and time left, above the prompt.
